tour feature-fit-graph
kind flow
author ai
group features/gui
note The Graph tab's 'fit' button zooms and pans so the whole graph fits the canvas with a margin, centred, shrinking the font step by step down to the smallest readable size; '1:1' sets the zoom back to 100% and centres the selected node. The reader reaches for it after panning and zooming into one part, to see the whole graph again without re-centring by hand. The camera otherwise moves only on explicit navigation.

