note Starting from the current font, steps the size down until the graph's cell bounds (nodes and sibling boxes) fit the canvas less the margins, or the smallest fit font is reached; the zoom is that font over the base one, and the pan centres the bounds in the room left inside the margins (the bounds' top-left at the margin when they fill it).

